{"id":50202,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50202"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:39:48","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:39:48","slug":"trail-terras-de-sal-e-serra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-terras-de-sal-e-serra\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Terras de Sal e Serra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Terras de Sal e Serra 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Terras de Sal e Serra 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Rio Maior<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Promovido pela Comiss\u00e3o Organizadora com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Rio Maior<\/strong> e a plataforma <strong>Recorde Pessoal<\/strong>, o evento proporciona uma experi\u00eancia aut\u00eantica e desafiante pelas paisagens singulares do Parque Natural das Serras de Aire e Candeeiros.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida exclusiva nas pitorescas <strong>Salinas Naturais de Rio Maior<\/strong> e consagra\u00e7\u00e3o no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Rio Maior<\/strong>, o evento arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> com o <strong>Trail Longo de 32 km (+1.400m D+)<\/strong>, \u00e0s 09:15 com o <strong>Trail Curto de 18 km (+800m D+)<\/strong> e \u00e0s 09:30 com o <strong>Mini Trail \/ Caminhada de 11 km (+400m D+)<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura transporte gratuito de autocarro entre o secretariado\/meta e o local de partida nas Salinas, disponibilizando almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no final com a t\u00edpica sopa da pedra e bifanas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Novembro de 